Error: Jet.ColumnarMethodNotSupported: Writing through `[ ]` isn't supported on a columnar list `[Particle]` yet
  --> Tests/UI/layout_columnar_unsupported_method.jet:8:7
    |
  8 |     ps[0] = Particle{x: 2.0, y: 3.0}
    |       ^^^
 Why: `#Layout(columnar)` lists support reading in v1 (indexing, field access, `len`, `is_empty`, `push`, iteration); index-write is deferred
 Fix: Drop `#Layout(columnar)` from `Particle` to assign through `[ ]`, or rebuild the list with `push`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ColumnarMethodNotSupported
